    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active SBQQ__PriceRule__c records with SBQQ__EvaluationOrder__c null.
Why it matters: CPQ runs unordered rules in an undefined sequence — they may interact with other rules unpredictably. Quotes show different prices on re-calc, with no clear root cause.
Suppress a finding: when only one rule exists and order is moot.
Disable the detector: leave on for any org with 2+ price rules.</value></values>
